# Project Tracker + Employee Portal — local setup (see docs/project-tracker/SETUP.md)
#
# 1. Copy this file to  .env.tracker.local   (that file is git-ignored — never commit it)
# 2. Fill in the three values below. Ask the project owner for them; they are the
#    Supabase project that holds the Project Tracker + Employee Portal data (NOT the live website project).
#    Only the browser-safe "anon / publishable" key goes here — never a service-role or secret key.
# 3. Run:  npm run dev:tracker
#
VITE_SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID="<project-ref>"
VITE_SUPABASE_URL="https://<project-ref>.supabase.co"
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY="<anon / publishable key>"
